.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Dependency lockfiles, Dockerfiles, Compose files, CI, migrations, seed SQL,
# configuration examples, and demo assets are intentionally not ignored.
